@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade DevOps - Flujo backend de compilacion, pruebas y empaquetado

component "mvn -B clean verify" as Maven EZ_DEVOPS
component "clean\nelimina target" as Clean
component "compile\nJava release 21" as Compile
component "test-compile" as TestCompile
component "test\npruebas JUnit/Mockito/Spring" as Test
component "verify\nverificacion del ciclo de vida" as Verify
component "spring-boot-maven-plugin" as BootPlugin
component "spring-modulith-starter-test\nApplicationModules.verify()" as ModulithTest
component "Pruebas de controller/service/domain/security/cache" as TestSuite

Maven --> Clean
Clean --> Compile
Compile --> TestCompile
TestCompile --> Test
Test --> TestSuite
Test --> ModulithTest
Test --> Verify
Verify --> BootPlugin : plugin disponible en la compilacion

note right of Compile
pom.xml declares java.version=23,
pero maven-compiler-plugin usa release=21.
CI installs JDK 23.
end note

note bottom
Evidencia: backend/pom.xml, backend/src/test/java y flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions.
No hay configurada una fase Maven de construccion de imagen Docker ni de despliegue.
end note

@enduml
